<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>{{{letterStyles}}}</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page en-body">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div>Letter No. {{letterNo}}</div>
    <div>Dated: {{issueDate}}</div>
  </div>

  <p>
    {{employeeName}}<br/>
    {{designation}}<br/>
    YCDO Pakistan.
  </p>

  <h1>NOTIFICATION</h1>

  <p>
    You are working as <strong>{{designation}}</strong> based at
    <strong>{{branch}}</strong>. We are pleased to inform you that your monthly
    emoluments are being revised with effect from <strong>{{effectiveDate}}</strong>,
    the detail is given hereunder:-
  </p>

  <table style="width:70%;">
    <tr>
      <td>01 Current Stipend</td>
      <td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{previousSalary}} Per Month</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>02 Enhancement</td>
      <td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{incrementAmount}} Per Month</strong></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>
    With the enhancement of <strong>Rs.{{incrementAmount}}/-</strong>, your total
    emoluments will be <strong>Rs.{{newSalary}}/-</strong> per month.
    {{#if incrementReason}}{{incrementReason}}{{else}}We expect that your services will be more effective and vigilant for our esteemed Organization.{{/if}}
    Best of Luck for future.
  </p>

  <div class="sign">
    <div>{{senderTitle}}</div>
    <div>YCDO Multan, Pakistan.</div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
